          "sol": "Step 1: Identify the values as recorded examination marks.\nStep 2: Recognise that each mark is an observation.\nStep 3: Choose a calculation that can use the marks, such as their total or mean.",
          "hint": "Identify the recorded observations before considering what they can be used to calculate.",
          "subject": "computer",
          "chapter": "basics",
          "topic": "Meaning of Data",
          "conceptId": "computer_basics_meaning_of_data",
          "skillId": "computer_basics",
          "subskillId": "computer_basics_q1"
