          "why": "This tests the ability to select and count records according to a stated condition.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Identify the recorded marks as data.\nStep 2: Select the marks below 50: 35 and 45.\nStep 3: Count the selected marks.\nStep 4: State the result in the context of the class.",
          "hint": "Apply the condition to each mark, then count the values that satisfy it.",
