          "why": "Speed and consistency are useful only when the underlying calculation is appropriate.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Identify the large number of repeated calculations.\nStep 2: Explain how the program saves time and applies a consistent method.\nStep 3: Identify the need for correct prices and formulas.",
          "hint": "Consider speed, repeated calculations and the quality of the formula.",
          "subject": "computer",
          "chapter": "basics",
