          "type": "text",
          "options": [],
          "steps": [
            "Step 1: Identify the large number of records.",
            "Step 2: Explain how a database can search by a field.",
            "Step 3: Name a measure that protects against data loss."
          ],
          "why": "Organised digital storage improves retrieval, while backups address the risk of losing data.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Identify the large number of records.\nStep 2: Explain how a database can search by a field.\nStep 3: Name a measure that protects against data loss.",
          "hint": "Think about searching and data recovery.",
          "subject": "computer",
