          "sol": "Step 1: Identify the programmed threshold of 30°C.\nStep 2: Compare the faulty sensor reading with the actual temperature.\nStep 3: Explain what the computer does with the supplied reading.",
          "hint": "Separate following the programmed rule from measuring reality correctly.",
