          "sol": "Step 1: Identify the event that interrupts the system.\nStep 2: Explain why the computer may become unavailable.\nStep 3: Suggest a suitable backup arrangement.",
          "hint": "Consider dependence on infrastructure and continuity arrangements.",
          "subject": "computer",
