          "sol": "Step 1: Identify the need to preserve the page's visual appearance.\nStep 2: Explain how scanning captures a digital image.\nStep 3: Identify the difference between an image and editable text.",
          "hint": "Consider what a scanner captures and what an image does not automatically provide.",
          "subject": "computer",
