          "sol": "Step 1: Write the file size: 3,000 bytes.\nStep 2: Multiply by 8 bits per byte.\nStep 3: Include the correct unit in the answer.",
          "hint": "One byte contains eight bits.",
          "subject": "computer",
          "chapter": "hardware",
          "topic": "Measuring Storage Capacity",
          "conceptId": "computer_hardware_measuring_storage_capacity",
          "skillId": "computer_hardware",
