          "q": "A computer has 500 GB of free SSD storage but only 2 GB of RAM. It struggles when several large applications are open. Explain why the free storage does not automatically solve the problem.",
          "ans": "Free SSD storage does not replace sufficient RAM. The OS may use storage to support virtual memory, but heavy paging can slow the computer.",
          "type": "text",
