          "why": "A file's name helps identify it, but it is not the same as the data stored inside the file.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Identify what renaming changes: the filename.\nStep 2: Identify what needs correction: the document's contents.\nStep 3: Open the document, edit the text and save the changes.",
          "hint": "Separate the file's label from the information stored inside it.",
          "subject": "computer",
          "chapter": "operating_systems",
          "topic": "File Management",
          "conceptId": "computer_operating_systems_file_management",
          "skillId": "computer_operating_systems",
          "subskillId": "computer_operating_systems_q3"
