          "why": "Lossy compression discards information and is unsuitable when every part of the original program data must remain unchanged.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Identify the requirement for exact reconstruction.\nStep 2: Compare lossless and lossy compression.\nStep 3: Choose a lossless method and verify the extracted file.",
