          "q": "A learner repeatedly postpones an available security update because it does not add visible features. Explain the risk and recommend a better approach.",
          "ans": "Postponing security updates can leave known vulnerabilities unpatched. Verify the update using the official updater and install it promptly under suitable conditions.",
