          "sol": "Step 1: Identify that the update addresses security weaknesses.\nStep 2: Recognize that unpatched weaknesses may be exploited.\nStep 3: Check the update through the trusted updater and install it according to the device's requirements.",
          "hint": "Security fixes can matter even when the user interface does not change.",
          "subject": "computer",
