          "why": "Comparing devices helps narrow the possible location of the fault, although a single comparison may not identify the exact cause.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Check that the laptop's Wi-Fi or network connection is enabled and connected to the intended network.\nStep 2: Test another device on the same network.\nStep 3: Use the comparison to guide further investigation.",
