          "why": "Account identity and profile information serve different purposes.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Identify the username as the account's identifying name.\nStep 2: Identify the desktop background as a profile preference.\nStep 3: Explain that changing the background need not change the username.",
          "hint": "One identifies the user; the other is a preference.",
          "subject": "computer",
