          "why": "Unique credentials limit the damage caused by a password leak.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Recognise that both accounts share one credential.\nStep 2: Explain that a password exposed on one service may be tried on the other.\nStep 3: Recommend unique, sufficiently long passwords for each account.",
          "hint": "Consider what happens if one service exposes the password.",
          "subject": "computer",
          "chapter": "operating_systems",
          "topic": "Authentication and Secure Sign-In",
          "conceptId": "computer_operating_systems_authentication_and_secure_sign_in",
