          "why": "Approving it could help someone else complete an authentication attempt.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Do not approve the request.\nStep 2: Access the account through the official channel.\nStep 3: Report the unexpected prompt and investigate possible unauthorised attempts.",
          "hint": "An approval should correspond to a sign-in you initiated.",
          "subject": "computer",
          "chapter": "operating_systems",
          "topic": "Authentication and Secure Sign-In",
