          "why": "Least privilege limits the impact of mistakes and unauthorised activity.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Identify the broad system-changing authority given to every learner.\nStep 2: Explain that mistakes or malicious programs could affect the whole computer.\nStep 3: Recommend standard accounts for daily use and authorised installation by a technician.",
