          "why": "The two actions manage the user's session differently.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Identify locking as restricting access to the existing session.\nStep 2: Identify signing out as ending the interactive session.\nStep 3: Explain why signing out is usually appropriate when finished on a shared computer.",
