          "why": "Changing a password alone may not terminate every existing session.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Access the official security settings from a trusted device.\nStep 2: Revoke the unfamiliar session if possible.\nStep 3: Change the password if compromise is suspected.\nStep 4: Review security settings and report the incident where appropriate.",
