          "why": "Device power behaviour and application session management are separate mechanisms.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Recognise that closing the lid may put the computer to sleep or trigger a configured action.\nStep 2: Explain that this does not necessarily end the operating-system session.\nStep 3: Explain that websites may maintain their own sessions.\nStep 4: Recommend locking or signing out as appropriate.",
          "hint": "Think about sleep, locking and sessions maintained by websites.",
          "subject": "computer",
          "chapter": "operating_systems",
          "topic": "Account Security and Session Management",
          "conceptId": "computer_operating_systems_account_security_and_session_management",
          "skillId": "computer_operating_systems",
